        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BC218R, Solid Brass Ball Catch with Round Corners</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBall catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. An adjustable ball catch, the ball retaining cylinder threads into the catch face plate for 1/2\" of adjustment. Available in 10 different finishes, packaged with matching screws. Used in conjunction with dummy hardware. Supplied with strike and mounting hardware, made of solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BC218R-Specifictions.gif?v=1704354658\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BC218R Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-deltana-bc218\"><b>Ball Catch with Square Corners</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BC218R Door Ball Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Corner Type: Round</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Depth: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment Length: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BC218R.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BC218R Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
