                "title": "Solid Brass Ball Catch With Round Corners",
                "description": "Solid Brass Ball Catch with Round Corners Deltana BC218R - Ball catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. An adjustable ball catch, the ball retaining cylinder threads into the catch face plate for 1/2 inches of adjustment. Available in 10 different finishes, packaged with matching screws. Used in conjunction with dummy hardware. Supplied with strike and mounting hardware, made of solid brass.",
